WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:03.587
- The Russians put
the first man on the moon.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.090
- We were so close.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.219
- We thought it was
about being first,

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:12.179
but the stakes
are much bigger than that.

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:14.723
- The world's changing.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.060
- This is the new front
in the Cold War.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.273
- The Soviets are going to build
a lunar military outpost.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.903
The president wants one too,
and he wants it first.

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:31.823
- We cannot allow space
to become another battlefield.

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:36.828
- Why would you want
weapons on the Moon?

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:39.289
- We're at war here.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.418
- You are our eyes
and ears up there.

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:44.294
(camera shutter clicks)

00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:46.588
- I didn't sign up for this.

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:50.050
- The Soviets are a threat to this base.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:54.137
- We need to send them a message.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.933
This is our territory.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.018
- Is this really happening?

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:07.067
- My God.

